Sval: the Translations panel's gear-menu help goes to Sval's support

The panel's second "Learn more" opens a hardcoded support.mozilla.org
address, where its first one is a moz-support-link that formats
app.support.baseURL. The gear menu's link formats the same pref with the
same page, so both go where Sval's support is.

